# Copy to .env and fill in. The app runs without this file; the Mock Interview
# falls back to typed answers graded by the bundled keyword matcher, and every
# other screen works offline either way.
#
# Get a key at https://console.groq.com. It pays for two things:
#   - Whisper, which turns a recorded answer into text in any language
#   - a chat model, which judges whether that answer means the right thing
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the JavaScript bundle, so this key is readable
# by anyone who downloads the app. That is the cost of having no server.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GROQ_API_KEY=
